    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Yer not from around here, are ya?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ти не звідси, чи не так?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Welcome to the bottom.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ласкаво просимо на дно.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Ya'll get used to the smell... eventually.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ви звикнете до запаху... зрештою.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Who's gonna keep the brutes in check if the Protectorate is gone?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Хто буде стримувати покидьків, якщо Protectorate зникне?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>The gangs are squeezin' us dry.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Банди вичавлюють з нас всі соки.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>I ain't happy that the Scrappers are gone. Only means the Eels will be squeezin' us harder now.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я не радий, що Scrappers зникли. Це лише означає, що Eels будуть вичавлювати з нас ще більше.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>That Fixer fellow's derailed as heck.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Цей Fixer зовсім з'їхав з глузду.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Ya got any eels to spare maybe? I'll give ya some tomorrow.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">У тебе є якісь вугри, можливо? Я тобі завтра віддам.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>I dunno what I'm gonna eat today.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я не знаю, що я буду їсти сьогодні.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Protectorate took the Scrappers down... Does this mean we're joinin' the Union? I hope so.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Protectorate знищив Scrappers... Це означає, що ми приєднаємось до Union? Сподіваюся.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q12" name="=&gt;q12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Why are Southgaters at the docks. I'm so confused...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Чому Southgaters біля доків. Я так розгублений...&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
